OL,3,GNEWSA'Flying doctor saved my sight
OL,4,Aafter dogs attacked me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman whose sight was saved by a
OL,7,Fdoctor on board a Midlands Air
OL,8,FAmbulance helicopter after a severe dog
OL,9,Fattack is backing calls for government
OL,10,Ffunding to ensure a doctor is on every
OL,11,Fflight.
OL,13,FLast December, Jenni Cross was walking
OL,14,Fdogs in a field at her smallholding in
OL,15,FColwall, Herefordshire, when a fight
OL,16,Fbroke out between them.
OL,18,FShe intervened to separate the dogs but
OL,19,Fwas knocked to the ground and attacked.
OL,20,FShe suffered severe facial injuries,
OL,21,Fpuncture wounds to her legs and a cut
OL,22,Fto her left hand that reached the bone.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
