OL,3,GNEWSA'Flying doctor saved my sight
OL,4,Aafter dogs attacked me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCross, 66, began to lose her vision but
OL,7,Fmanaged to walk back to her home to
OL,8,Fcall a vet for the injured animals. A
OL,9,F999 call was made to seek urgent
OL,10,Ftreatment for her.
